# Medicail Flutter architecture

- `lib/core/`: infrastructure (DI, network, router, i18n, utils, abstract services)
- `lib/features/`: business logic (`domain/`, `data/`, `presentation/` with BLoC)
- `lib/pages/`: route-bound screens (thin, no network/STT logic)
- `lib/widget/`: reusable design system

## Rules

- Business state via `flutter_bloc` only in `features/*/presentation/`
- DI via `get_it` + `@injectable`; never `Dio()` or `SpeechToText()` in the UI
- Navigation via `go_router` and `AppRoutes` constants
- UI strings via `AppLocalizations`; no hardcoded strings in pages
